#10;What this means&#10;Forgiveness starts with truth, not pretending the wound was small.&#10;Why it matters&#10;God meets honest pain and teaches freedom without denying justice.&#10;Try this today&#10;Name the situation, then choose one faithful action before the day ends.&#10;Where this shows up&#10;A general question can still become deeply personal when tied to one real situation.&#10;Action steps&#10;2&#10;Pause&#10;Take two quiet minutes and name the real situation without exaggerating or minimizing it.&#10;Clarity makes obedience more concrete.&#10;3&#10;Pray&#10;Ask God for one faithful response you can practice today.&#10;Prayer turns reflection into dependence.&#10;10&#10;Practice&#10;Put a seven-day reminder on your calendar for one small spiritual practice.&#10;Small embodied action keeps the question from staying abstract.&#10;More questions&#10;2 waiting" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[55,93][1025,2177]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.elbiblio.app" content-desc="Answered today" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="false" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[154,1335][665,1478]" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.elbiblio.app" content-desc="Hide guide" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[154,1500][519,1632]" /></node></node></node></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.Button" package="com.elbiblio.app" content-desc="Open navigation menu" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true"